            <section ID="id_link_437e5bfb-f82e-9514-e063-6294a90a66c5">
               <id root="498c70e9-f633-ae9d-e063-6394a90a85b1"/>
               <code code="34089-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="DESCRIPTION SECTION"/>
               <title>
                  <content styleCode="bold">CHEMICAL STRUCTURE</content>
               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Salicylic acid is the 2-hydroxy derivative of benzoic acid having the following structure:
